; The fast suite (FP replays/fuzz + single-instruction CPU lockstep + the lib's inline
; tests) runs on `dune runtest` in a few seconds. Everything heavier is opt-in, by alias,
; and lives in a subdirectory (AGENT.md §6):
;   boot/            the boot harness + the sim-SoC gates   @boot_checkpoint @visual_golden
;   board/nexys-4/   the board-SoC gates + the board gauge  @boot_checkpoint_board
;                                                           @visual_golden_board @bench_boot
;   cosim/           RTL co-simulation under Verilator      @cosim
;   formal/          equivalence and property proofs        @formal
;   bench/           the target-independent gauges          @bench @profile_boot
; `dune build @gates` (the root dune file) runs every gate.

; The fetched reference RTL (test/_po) and all test scratch (test/_work — Verilator obj_dirs,
; dumped traces, the downloaded zip, yosys/z3 intermediates) are git-ignored generated trees;
; mark them data-only so dune never scans them for build rules.

(data_only_dirs _po _work)

